course: dictionary
lesson: 15356
title: Small pieces inside longer words
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words are small pieces hiding inside longer words. «Som» is one of them. In English you usually meet it as a fragment, a piece of a longer word like «some», «blossom» or «somersault».
explain: In some countries, the som is money. It is the money of Kyrgyzstan and Uzbekistan, just as the pound is money in Britain. «The bag of apples in the market cost 150 som.» The words around som tell you it is money, because you pay for apples with money.
explain: Be careful, because words in other languages can look the same. In Ukrainian, сом means catfish, a big river fish with whiskers. «Ivan caught a сом in the river.» That is a different language, so check which language you are reading before you decide what a word means.
explain: Context tells you which meaning you need. If the sentence is about paying for things, som is money. If it is about a river and fishing, it is the Ukrainian word for catfish. Read the words around it first, then ask: does my meaning fit here?
fact: Context means the words and sentences around a word.
fact: «Som» means the money of Kyrgyzstan and Uzbekistan.
fact: «Сом» means catfish in Ukrainian; it is not an English word.
fact: In English, «som» is usually a fragment of longer words such as «some», «somersault» and «blossom».
fact: A fragment is a small piece of a longer word, and it is not always a word on its own.
exercise: «The bag of apples in the market cost 150 som.» What does som mean here? | *Money, the currency of Kyrgyzstan | A kind of fruit | A type of shop | A river fish with whiskers
exercise: «Sam did a somersault on the mat.» Which small piece is at the start of somersault? | ers | *som | mer | ault
exercise: In a Ukrainian reading book, «сом» appears in a sentence about a river. What does it mean? | A shop | Money | *A catfish | A blossom on a tree
test: «The children counted the som in the shop.» What does som mean? | A big river fish | *Money | A flower | A school subject
test: Which English word starts with the fragment «som»? | Sob | Sum | Sop | *Some
exam: Ruby reads «The price was 200 som.» Which meaning fits best? | *Money of Kyrgyzstan and Uzbekistan | Blossom | Somersault | Catfish
